  "solution": {
    "text": "The sum of the coefficients is zero <math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is a root <math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is a factor.<br /><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now, <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mro